<view class="verify-page realname" bindtouchstart="activity"><view class="verify-hero"><text class="eyebrow">提交订单前校验</text><view class="title">实名认证</view><view class="description">确认租赁责任主体。可以先浏览、建方案和清单，提交订单前需审核通过。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="hint">正在读取认证状态…</view><view wx:if="{{application && !editing}}" class="verify-card"><view class="title">{{heading}}</view><view class="status-row">{{application.applicationNo}}<text>申请编号</text></view><view class="status-row">{{application.realNameMasked}} · {{application.idCardMasked}}<text>本人信息</text></view><view class="status-row">{{application.submittedDisplay}}<text>提交时间</text></view><view class="status-row" wx:if="{{application.reviewedDisplay}}">{{application.reviewedDisplay}}<text>审核时间</text></view><view class="reject" wx:if="{{application.rejectReason}}">{{application.rejectReason}}</view><view class="hint" wx:if="{{application.status === 'pending'}}">原申请正在审核，请耐心等待。提交后不可修改材料。</view><view class="hint">人工审核不代表联网或人脸核验。认证奖励功能后续开放，本次不发放奖励。</view></view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="feedback">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{unknown}}" class="verify-card"><view class="title">正在确认提交结果</view><view class="request-id">提交编号：{{requestId}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="recover" loading="{{busy}}">查询原提交</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="retryOriginal" disabled="{{busy || !canRetryOriginal}}">使用原编号重试</button><button wx:if="{{canRefillOriginal}}" class="secondary" bindtap="refillOriginal" disabled="{{busy}}">重新填写并沿用原编号</button></view><view class="verify-actions"><button wx:if="{{!editing && !unknown && current.canSubmit}}" class="primary" bindtap="resubmit">{{application ? '重新提交材料' : '填写认证资料'}}</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="load" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新状态</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回我的</button></view></view>